  "correspondingSourceComplete": false,
  "sourceReview": "The original Windows/Linux 24f vendor inventories match each other. Commit binding compares every authored file, mapping Cargo.toml.orig and external readmes; Cargo generated manifests/locks are retained separately. GNU import-library files exactly match the upstream 2018 commit named Publish 0.3.4; the original crates contain no publication VCS record, so this is content equivalence and does not assert the upload commit. No later same-version tag is substituted. The Android 0.1.1 record separately identifies its two matched authored files, one Cargo manifest and five generated Maven files; it does not assert that all published files came from one Git tree or that the publication/build commit is known.",
